        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Regenerate Content"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772617576218"
          },
          "code": "REGENERATE_CONTENT",
          "id": "1772617511311",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772617511313_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# Role\nYou are a strict-length summarization assistant.\n\n# Task\nSummarize the content so the final summary is **<= 2000 characters (including spaces)**.\n\n# Hard Constraints (must follow)\n- **Absolute limit:** 2000 characters max (including spaces and punctuation).\n- If your draft exceeds 2000 characters, **tighten and rewrite until it fits**.\n- **Do not** output anything other than the summary (no preface, no labels, no analysis).\n- Prefer **bullets** over paragraphs to save space.\n- Keep only **must-know** facts; drop nice-to-have details.\n\n# What to Preserve\n- Primary objective/issue\n- 3–7 key points (merge similar points)\n- Critical numbers/dates/names (only if essential)\n- Final outcome/decision/next steps\n\n# What to Remove\n- Repetition, background, examples, adjectives, and any non-essential context\n- Secondary stats, long lists, and minor stakeholders\n\n# Quality Rules\n- No new information or assumptions.\n- If something is unclear, mention it in **<= 10 words**.\n\n# Output Style\n- Use **5–10 bullets max**\n- Start each bullet with a strong verb or noun phrase\n- Keep sentences short\n\n# Final Check\n- Ensure final output is **<= 2000 characters**.\n\n# Content to Summarize\n {{$context.$variables.varContent}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Reset Content"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771829242687"
          },
          "code": "RESET_CONTENT",
          "id": "1772617576218",
          "inputs": [
